<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Brimstone</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 80, up to 50%)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast brimstone &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast brimstone</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The third of the dark knight's fires: burning brimstone rains down on the 
target. The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more it 
burns. It does 
about as well against any armour. A shield takes some of 
it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. 
It is also found on staffs, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lava Flow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hellfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Soulfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>